# Agent capability

Making the agents smarter is a first-class goal alongside the control system. An agent
forced to guess, rediscover authority, or act without seeing the effect of its last
mutation is a harness defect, not a model limitation to paper over with a longer prompt.

## Wanted

- New instruments at the owning boundary when a role is forced to guess
- Context compiled to the active work unit (kickoff, CLAUDE.md, and `unit_scope`)
- Binding structured decisions compiled to the selected bundle at materialization
- Frame authority compiled at materialization (layer judge, extra-frame contract_ids binding)
- Recipe retrieval ranked against the active unit's mutation roles, with abstention
- Repair abstention (`cannot_express_in_scope`) that stops the remaining budget
- Tool policy that enumerates legal actions and names violations
- Teaching `run_bpy` errors that name the bound instrument the agent reinvented
- Named argmax on scalar bound evidence (`curve_derivative_max` note)
- Look-less live preview defaults to Workbench, not EEVEE
- Look-owning repair probe includes a draft beauty plate, not only solid
- Shared-role check_scene names object=; list_keyframes enumerates the hosts
- Status detail is the stop meaning, not the exit-code digit
- Materialization binds a durable transcript like global plan
- Look-less layer composition fans in unit executable verdicts, not a critic look vote
- Repair `cannot_express_in_scope` is bound on the candidate session, not blender ToolSearch
- Look-without-image-contracts does not lock `run_bpy` on a 0/0 critic handoff
- Unit judge frames covered by required claims, not a critic fall-through
- Look-owning units cannot seal on scene counts
- Claim-closure counts look image-contract ids as build-time debts
- Compiled image-debt card (id, frame, property, axis); freeze refuses unpaid
- A keyframe_schedule path miss names object and data-block fcurve paths; empty keys are not INAPPLICABLE
- Required visible_fraction is repaired by a camera or role mutator, not a volume-only unit
- Multi-role visible_fraction is AND; a union cannot hide a named role below lo
- Geometry units freeze-protect lifecycle-active vis on this layer, including sibling rows
- Derived write-cluster publication (no authored family string), read-only consumed interfaces, and digest-bound publish/consume identity
- Camera availability only from typed `provides`; role names never imply a capability
- Camera-dependent evidence cannot publish before a camera provider
- Role-bound global camera capability whose dependency closure reaches every judged layer
- Closed WorkUnit authoring schema on the staging tool
- Point-projection consume matches the exporting interface
- Locked revision-checked materialization candidate writes; patch cannot insert stage rows
- Closed-loop mutation: every write has a matching observation
- Deferred-owner domain AND-coverage against the owner layer's already-validated evidence_domains
- Earned qualitative judgment where executable evidence cannot decide

## Not wanted

- Larger prompts or longer sessions as the scaling strategy
- Prompt-only patches for mechanical defects
- A confident model verdict replacing executable evidence
- Extra mutation authority so a builder can "figure it out"

Query, measure, enumerate, close the loop, abstain when evidence is insufficient.
A recurring guess is a missing tool: build it at the owning boundary and grant it to the
roles that need it. Binding copy lives in `AGENTS.md`.
